      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">RECALL · 3 MIN</span><h2>Warm-up recall</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Recall before opening today’s chunk cards. Ôn theo mốc bài học +1, +3, +7, +14; mỗi lần chọn vài chunk để giữ bài gọn.</p><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 12 · ôn sau 1 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Invite someone to check something with you. <small>Say one sentence from memory.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Could you help me check whether the issue affects mobile users?\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 10 · ôn sau 3 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Offer one explanation to investigate. <small>Use it in a different project or situation.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"One possibility is that too many people are using the app.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 6 · ôn sau 7 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Start a friendly conversation about progress. <small>Say two connected sentences aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"How's it going? Is the new page ready?\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div>"
