      "id": "reading",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">INPUT · 4 MIN</span><h2>Read, listen to your own voice, and notice</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read once for meaning. Then read aloud; on the second pass, notice how the speaker uses whole phrases.</p><div class=\"reading\">We're having an issue with the old service. I've already tried restarting it, but it didn't solve the issue. One option is to repair it today. The advantage is that we can finish quickly. However, the downside is that the same problem may return. Another option is to replace the service. That takes more time, but it will be easier to maintain. I'd recommend fixing it today and planning a replacement next week. The impact is a long wait for customers, so we need a short-term solution while we prepare something better.</div>"
    },
